ing fundamentals keep the race close. Headlines in late September focus on Acton facing criticism for skipping debates, gas tax relief plans, and a contest framed around Covid, health costs, and trust in science. Small shifts in turnout or messaging could decide the outcome.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.545, "margin": 0.49}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.5929, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.5919, "margin": 1.0}]}